<!--
  Every page on mastipe.in that is worth indexing.

  The marketing page is one scrolling document, so its sections are anchors and
  are deliberately not listed - a crawler already has them. The policies are
  different: each is its own route, each is linked to directly by Meta,
  Razorpay and the WhatsApp consent card, and each is the kind of page somebody
  searches for by name.

  lastmod is maintained by hand. Automating it from the database was tempting -
  the policy text lives there now - but a sitemap that reports "changed today"
  on every deploy teaches crawlers to ignore the field. It should move when the
  words move.

  The Hindi site is the same URL with the language chosen in the page, so it is
  declared as an alternate rather than a second entry.
-->
